                      |         Create Indexes          |
                      |---------------------------------|
                      |                                 |
                      |              (Y)es              |
                      |              (N)o               |
                      |                                 |
                      |---------------------------------|
                      |  Most mail readers require the  |
                      |  indexes to be made.  However,  |
                      |  if your reader does not, then  |
                      |  you can choose "No", and your  |
                      |  mail will be packed quicker.   |
